    "excerpt": {
      "fr": "Une inondation dÃ©vastatrice Ã  la frontiÃ¨re nÃ©palo-tibÃ©taine a fait des centaines de victimes, tandis que les autoritÃ©s craignent une rupture imminente de lacs glaciaires instables.",
      "en": "A devastating flood on the Nepal-Tibet border has claimed hundreds of lives, as authorities warn of the imminent risk of unstable glacial lake bursts."
